        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Subject to availability of funding, concerning retirement benefits, the Employer and the Union agree attendance at these briefings are essential to a successful retirement. As such, the parties agree Employee attendance should take place within the first three (3) years after initial appointment and no later than five (5) years prior to retirement.",
